  m_text: "\n\nStrength (STR) is good for fighting tasks, \nHaste (HST) HST is good
    for fixing tasks, \nwhile Wisdom (WIS) and Scavenge (SCV) are good for looting
    tasks.\nScavenge is a unique stat as it helps give out more loot!\n\nUse your
    (+) wisely!"
